[[File:Grim Hollow.png|thumb|300px|The Grim Hollow.]]
'''The Grim Hollow''' is a wooded swamp located in the southern [[Grim Reaches]]. As of late, a darkness has seeped into the Hollow. The spirits of the dead interred in the [[Tomb of Ancestors]] walk again,<ref name="Grim Hollow">{{questlong|Neutral|37|The Grim Hollow (quest)|The Grim Hollow}}</ref> the red dragonkin that patrol the marsh are ensnared by the same corruption that poisons the land,<ref>{{questlong|Neutral|39|Tomb of Ancestors (quest)|Tomb of Ancestors}}</ref> and even the wildlife is overgrown and sickly - the spiders in particular swarm the swamp trails like they own the place.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|34|Creeping Trouble}}</ref> The mist hangs thick, and the shadows feel like they're watching travelers.<ref name="Grim Hollow" />

